---
import { Container } from '@components/react/Container';
import { Heading } from '@components/react/Heading';
import { CONTACT_EMAIL, OWNER, SITE_TITLE, TOWN } from '@/consts';
import Layout from '@/layouts/Page.astro';
---

<Layout
  title={`Imprint | ${SITE_TITLE}`}
  description="Imprint and disclosure according to § 25 of the Austrian Media Act."
>
  <Container as="main">
    <div class="px-4">
      <Heading noMargin className="mb-8">Imprint</Heading>
      <div class="prose lg:prose-lg">
        <p>
          Disclosure according to § 25 of the Austrian Media Act (Offenlegung gemäß § 25
          Mediengesetz).
        </p>

        <h2>Media owner, publisher and author</h2>
        <p>
          {OWNER}<br />
          {TOWN}<br />
          Austria
        </p>
        <p>
          Email: <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`}>{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a>
        </p>

        <h2>Ownership</h2>
        <p>
          This website is owned and run solely by {OWNER} as a private individual. There are no shareholders,
          no participations, no silent partnerships and no trust arrangements, and no third party holds
          any ownership, voting or profit-sharing rights in it. I hold no stake in any other media undertaking
          (§ 25 (3) Mediengesetz).
        </p>

        <h2>Purpose and editorial direction (Blattlinie)</h2>
        <p>
          A private, non-commercial weblog. It publishes articles on software development, servers
          and self-hosting, along with notes on the hardware and software I use. Everything here is
          my personal opinion and is not written on behalf of my employer or any other party.
        </p>
        <p>
          Declaration of the fundamental editorial direction under § 25 (4) of the Austrian Media
          Act: this site is independent, not bound to any political party, religious body, company
          or interest group, and carries no advertising, paid or sponsored content. It advocates
          open source software, self-hosting, data protection and a free and open internet, and
          reflects nothing beyond my own personal views.
        </p>

        <h2>Responsibility for content</h2>
        <p>
          The content of this site was written with care, but I cannot guarantee that it is
          accurate, complete or current — especially in older articles, where the software described
          has often moved on. Please verify anything you rely on; nothing here is professional
          advice.
        </p>

        <h2>Links to other sites</h2>
        <p>
          This site links to sites I do not operate. I have no influence over their content and take
          no responsibility for it; the respective operator is responsible. If you let me know that
          a linked page has become unlawful, I will remove the link.
        </p>

        <h2>Copyright and trade marks</h2>
        <p>
          The articles are mine and are licensed to no one else. You are welcome to quote from one
          with attribution and a link; for anything beyond that, please ask first. Screenshots
          reproduce the interface of the software they show and are used here to illustrate the
          text.
        </p>
        <p>
          Plenty here is not mine, though. The product images on the gear page, the logos used as
          article icons, the framework and language marks in the text and the donation button belong
          to their respective owners and are used only to identify the product or project they stand
          for, not to suggest any endorsement of or affiliation with this site. The framework glyphs
          come from{' '}
          <a href="https://simpleicons.org">Simple Icons</a> under CC0 1.0; that licence covers the files,
          not the marks they depict.
        </p>
        <p>
          If you hold rights in anything shown here — a mark, a logo or a photograph — and would
          rather it were not used, write to me at{' '}
          <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`}>{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a> and I will take it down.
        </p>

        <p>
          How this site handles your data is described in the <a href="/privacy">privacy policy</a>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </Container>
</Layout>
